---
/* Section 2: the big vision (the founder's choice on 2026-11-22: B as the big vision, the one
   million as the measurable ambition further down), then who "anyone" means, then the change
   that makes it possible. */
---

<section class="section future" id="vision" aria-labelledby="future-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="future__head" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">Why we exist</p>
      <h2 class="future__title" id="future-title">
        We want to make it possible for anyone in the world to become an entrepreneur,
        <span class="soft">regardless of their access to capital, expertise or a traditional team.</span>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="future__grid">
      <p class="future__lines" data-reveal>
        <span>With or without a job.</span>
        <span>With or without a team.</span>
        <span>With the leverage of AI.</span>
      </p>
      <div class="prose" data-reveal>
        <p>
          For generations, starting a business meant assembling people, finding expertise,
          managing tools and coordinating countless activities.
        </p>
        <p><strong>The opportunity is changing.</strong></p>
        <p>
          Imagine an individual with access to the intelligence and execution capabilities
          traditionally found across an entire company. More people could turn their knowledge,
          creativity and ambition into sustainable businesses.
        </p>
        <p class="future__end">That is the future we are building toward.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .future__head {
    margin-bottom: clamp(48px, 6vw, 80px);
  }

  .future__title {
    max-width: 30ch;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 52px);
    font-weight: 650;
    line-height: 1.12;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .future__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(32px, 6vw, 96px);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .future__lines {
    display: grid;
    gap: 6px;
    padding-left: 20px;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--text);
    font-size: clamp(22px, 2.4vw, 30px);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .future__end {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .future__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
